        "created_at": "2011-10-15T14:45:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Forgive me if this has been asked before.</p>\n<p>If Traffic Pileup is in play, but another card or Power allows a Hero to draw cards, which takes precedence?</p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>",
