        "created_at": "2011-10-15T16:38:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Awesome. Thank you for the prompt response.</p>\n<p>I just took Tachyon and Visionary against Baron Blade, and that card pretty much shut them down. Glad it was the Environment that shut them down and not my mis-play.</p>\n<p>Whew.</p>\n<p>Note to self: No more Tachyon and Visionary Team ups in Megalopolis unless there are more heroes to help. Got it.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
